      "ExternalDescriptionStr": "<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Job Title:</span><span> Character Co-op Student Fellow (Grant) (WS-ST3)</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Classification: </span><span>Student Employee (non-exempt)</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Name and Address of Employer: </span><span>St. Olaf College, 1520 St. Olaf Ave, Northfield, MN 55057</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Department Name:</span><span> Character in Community Project</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Unit Number (5 digits): </span><span>n/a</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Length of Position: </span><span>Academic Year </span><span style=\"font-weight:700\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-style:italic\">See Employment Authorization for specific dates</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0\">\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; font-style:italic; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\">September through Mid-May: 4-6&nbsp; hours a week </span><span>(on average)</span></p></li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Contact Person/Supervisor:</span><span> Assistant Director of Character in Community Project</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Wage Range: </span><span>$12.00-13.00/hour</span></p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Description of the Position:</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span>This role is ideal for a motivated, organized, and people-oriented student who is passionate about character and leadership development and wants to gain hands-on experience in program administration, event planning, research and communications. The Character in Community Student Fellow position works closely with the project's Director and Assistant Director to ensure a seamless experience for all participants across character and leadership programming. This position itself is a leadership experience – the Fellow will grow in project management, professional communication, and organizational skills while playing a meaningful behind-the-scenes role in shaping the project.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Transferable Skills:</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0\">\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Written and Verbal Communication</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Leadership</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Time Management</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Assessment and Analytical Skills</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Event Planning</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Customer Service</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Program Development</span></p></li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Duties and Responsibilities:&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0\">\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Assist with workshop, seminar, Learning Community, and signature event preparations</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Maintain calendars and send timely communications to students, mentors, and faculty as outlined by the Director and Assistant Director</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Help coordinate cross-track activities and large gatherings</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Support preparation of program materials, handouts, and presentation resources</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Help with record-keeping of student participation, milestones, and portfolio/project submissions</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Draft social media content</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Assist with designing promotional materials for programs</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Represent the Character in Community Project professionally at various events</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Assist at large-scale programs as needed</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Pursue research on program efficacy and improvements</span></p></li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Qualifications: (Education/Experience/Skills)</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0\">\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Must have at least two years of experience at St. Olaf College in a student organization, class leadership role, or other co-curricular spaces</span><span> </span><span>Must have an interest in student development of </span><span>character and leadership.</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Expected to </span><span>have effective communication, time management, and organizational skills.</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Ability to be an </span><span>energetic, motivated student leader.</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Needs to be in good academic standing.</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Must value DEIAB&nbsp; practices to support our project efforts &amp;&nbsp; be comfortable working with and uplifting people from diverse backgrounds and identities.</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Excellent written and verbal communication skills are required.</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Must not be found in violation of any St. Olaf policies.</span></p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc; padding-left:18pt\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>Proficient in Google Workspaces and Social Media platforms</span></p></li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-left:18pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">This job description is for general information purposes.&nbsp; It is not intended to list all duties and responsibilities of the position.&nbsp; This job description is subject to change at any time by St. Olaf College, with or without prior notice.</span></p>\n<div>\n <span style=\"font-weight:700\"><br></span>\n</div>",
